+R:  49 | +  * compensating path becomes the routine one. The assertion below encodes that so a future edit to one
+R:  50 | +  * number can't silently invert the relationship.
+R:  51 | +  *
+R:  52 | +  * These are starting values tuned for a healthy link. They are NOT trustworthy until measured on the real
