+R: 214 | +         // COMMONS_POOL *account* is overwritten by the next persistCommonsBalance() flush, so the fee
+R: 215 | +         // would vanish from the books and the node would stop summing to zero.
+R: 216 | +         if (row.fee > 0 && !moveToCommons(escrowAccount, row.fee, `Cross-community purchase fee (${key})`)) {
