+R: 430 | + ### 2.6 What "signed receipt" means, and two guards it does not cover
+R: 431 | + 
+R: 432 | + Three details settled while building the exchange. Each is a place where the obvious implementation is
+R: 433 | + wrong in a way that only shows up as beans in the wrong place.
