+R: 447 | + exists. Amount, buyer, seller and post are all inside the signature too, and are re-checked against the
+R: 448 | + reservation: a validly-signed receipt naming a larger amount than was reserved must be refused, because the
+R: 449 | + cap check authorised the reserved figure and nothing else.
